      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Скажите такая конструкция хуже?<br />\nоткрыть <b>memberlist.php</b><br />\nнайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">// per-letter selection end\n$sql = &quot;SELECT username, user_id, user_rank, user_opt, user_posts, user_regdate, user_from, user_website, user_email\n        FROM &quot;. BB_USERS .&quot;\n        WHERE user_id NOT IN(&quot;. EXCLUDED_USERS_CSV .&quot;)&quot;;</pre>в строку после <b>user_email</b> вставить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">, rank_image, rank_title, rank_style</pre>после <b>FROM &quot;. BB_USERS .&quot;</b> на следующей строке вставить<br />\nвставить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">LEFT JOIN bb_ranks ON ( rank_id = user_rank )</pre> <br />\nнайти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">            $www = &#039;&#039;;\n        }</pre>после вставить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">        // USER RANK\n        if ($row[&#039;user_rank&#039;])\n        {\n            $rank = ($bb_cfg[&#039;show_rank_image&#039;]) ? &#039;&lt;img src=&quot;&#039;.$row[&#039;rank_image&#039;].&#039;&quot; alt=&quot;&#039;.$row[&#039;rank_title&#039;].&#039;&quot; title=&quot;&#039;.$row[&#039;rank_title&#039;].&#039;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&#039; : &#039;&lt;b class=&quot;&#039;.$row[&#039;rank_style&#039;].&#039;&quot;&gt;&#039;.$row[&#039;rank_title&#039;].&#039;&lt;/b&gt;&#039;;\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            $rank = &#039;&#039;;\n        }\n        // END USER RANK</pre>найти<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&#039;WWW&#039;          =&gt; $www,</pre>после вставить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&#039;RANK&#039;          =&gt; $rank,</pre> <br />\nпо шаблону<br />\nЭта часть любезно предоставлена автором🙂<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">#\n#-----[ ОТКРЫТЬ ]------------------------------------------------\n#\ntemplates/default/memberlist.tpl\n#\n#-----[ НАЙТИ ]------------------------------------------------\n#\n      &lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: &#039;text&#039;}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;{L_USERNAME}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;\n#\n#-----[ ПОСЛЕ ВСТАВИТЬ ]------------------------------------------------\n#\n&lt;th class=&quot;{sorter: false}&quot; &gt;&lt;b class=&quot;tbs-text&quot;&gt;{L_POSTER_RANK}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;\n#\n#-----[ НАЙТИ ]------------------------------------------------\n#\n      &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;{memberrow.USER}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n#\n#-----[ ПОСЛЕ ВСТАВИТЬ ]------------------------------------------------\n#\n&lt;td&gt;{memberrow.RANK}&lt;/td&gt;</pre>",
